{"route":"hyperlinks","routeLabel":"Hyperlink entries","scriptId":"0160","lineCount":101,"lines":[{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000006","line":6,"sourceId":"0160:000006","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　触れた唇のぬくもりが、胸の奥にまで染み込んで\nいく。","english":"The warmth of her lips sank deep into his chest.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000007","line":7,"sourceId":"0160:000007","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　こんな感覚はそう味わえるものではない。\n　現に、忍はぬくもりに比例する戸惑いも感じていた。","english":"It was not a feeling one often got to experience. Yet the warmer it grew, the more bewildered Shinobu became.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000011","line":11,"sourceId":"0160:000011","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「……忍？」","english":"“…Shinobu?”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000012","line":12,"sourceId":"0160:000012","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「っ」","english":"“—”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000013","line":13,"sourceId":"0160:000013","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「なにを戸惑っているの？　……今更」","english":"“Why are you hesitating? …It’s a little late for that.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000014","line":14,"sourceId":"0160:000014","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　相手に隙があれば、そこからすぐに逆襲する。\n　それが本堂沙也加だ。","english":"At the slightest opening, she struck back at once. That was Sayaka Hondou.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000015","line":15,"sourceId":"0160:000015","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「強引なのはもうおしまいなのかしら」","english":"“Done being forceful, are you?”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000016","line":16,"sourceId":"0160:000016","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「強引だなんて」","english":"“Forceful? I wasn’t…”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000017","line":17,"sourceId":"0160:000017","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「強引よ、そして唐突……いつもね」","english":"“You were forceful—and sudden… You always are.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000018","line":18,"sourceId":"0160:000018","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　反論できず、渋い顔をしてしまう。\n　沙也加は更に余裕を持って、忍の胸に顔を埋めた。","english":"He had no answer, and his face soured. Even more at ease now, Sayaka buried her face in his chest.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000019","line":19,"sourceId":"0160:000019","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「なにも恐れることはないわ。\n　あなたは、あなたの思うようにすればいい」","english":"“There is nothing to fear. Do as you wish.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000020","line":20,"sourceId":"0160:000020","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「キスを？」","english":"“Kiss you?”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000021","line":21,"sourceId":"0160:000021","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「キスでも、キス以外のことでも……\n　構わないって言ったでしょう？」","english":"“Kiss me, or do something else… I told you I didn’t mind, didn’t I?”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000022","line":22,"sourceId":"0160:000022","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「……うん」","english":"“…Yeah.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000023","line":23,"sourceId":"0160:000023","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　本能的な欲求をさらけ出せばいい。\n　沙也加の目には、更なる充足を求める強い輝き\nが見えた。","english":"All he had to do was lay his instinctive desire bare. In Sayaka’s eyes he could see a fierce gleam: she wanted more.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000024","line":24,"sourceId":"0160:000024","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　忍はそれを綺麗だと思い、合わせ鏡のようにその\n欲求を自分のものとする。","english":"Shinobu found it beautiful. Like one mirror facing another, he made her desire his own.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000029","line":29,"sourceId":"0160:000029","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　すると、体が自然と動いていた。","english":"Then his body moved of its own accord.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000030","line":30,"sourceId":"0160:000030","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「……あ、ん……」","english":"“…Ah… mm…”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000031","line":31,"sourceId":"0160:000031","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「…………」","english":"“…………”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000032","line":32,"sourceId":"0160:000032","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　体勢ひとつで立場が変わったように感じられる。\n　立てば大差のない身長同士。しかしこれで、明ら\nかに忍の方が上位となった。","english":"A single change in position made it feel as though their roles had reversed. Standing, they were almost the same height. Like this, however, Shinobu clearly had the upper hand.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000033","line":33,"sourceId":"0160:000033","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「あぁ、あなたのものにされている気分」","english":"“Ahh… I feel like I’m becoming yours.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000034","line":34,"sourceId":"0160:000034","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「とても心地良いわ……今、この時は」","english":"“It feels wonderful… at this moment.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000035","line":35,"sourceId":"0160:000035","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「もっとしていい？」","english":"“Can I do more?”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000036","line":36,"sourceId":"0160:000036","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「えぇ、もちろん」","english":"“Yes, of course.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000037","line":37,"sourceId":"0160:000037","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「匂いも」","english":"“Your scent too?”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000038","line":38,"sourceId":"0160:000038","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「ふしだらね」","english":"“How indecent.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000039","line":39,"sourceId":"0160:000039","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「……違うってば」","english":"“…That isn’t what I meant.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000040","line":40,"sourceId":"0160:000040","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　実のところ、本当に違うのかどうかはわからない。","english":"Truthfully, he wasn’t sure it really was different.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000041","line":41,"sourceId":"0160:000041","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　けれどこうした状況で、キス以外、というものの\n知識がある忍としてはどうしてもそちらの方へと結\nびつけてしまう。","english":"But here and now, knowing what “something other than kissing” could mean, Shinobu could not help letting his thoughts run in that direction.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000042","line":42,"sourceId":"0160:000042","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　いや、男としては、と言うべきだろうか。","english":"Or perhaps he should say: as a man.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000043","line":43,"sourceId":"0160:000043","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「……ん……んん……」","english":"“…Mm… mmm…”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000044","line":44,"sourceId":"0160:000044","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「……なにか匂う？」","english":"“…Do you smell anything?”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000045","line":45,"sourceId":"0160:000045","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「どうかな、よくわからないけど……」","english":"“I’m not sure. I can’t really tell, but…”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000046","line":46,"sourceId":"0160:000046","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「…………」","english":"“…………”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000047","line":47,"sourceId":"0160:000047","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「これが沙也加の匂いなんだって、理解はできる」","english":"“I do know this is what you smell like, Sayaka.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000048","line":48,"sourceId":"0160:000048","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「そう」","english":"“I see.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000052","line":52,"sourceId":"0160:000052","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「ん……んん……ちゅ、んむ、ん～ぅ……」","english":"“Mm… mmm… Mmph, nnnh, mmm…”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000053","line":53,"sourceId":"0160:000053","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　遠慮なく重ねた唇に吸い付き合う。\n　唇を、頬を、そして首筋まで。","english":"They kissed without restraint, sucking at each other’s lips. Then came cheeks, and finally necks.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000054","line":54,"sourceId":"0160:000054","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「あ……ん……んん、んぁ、\n　あぁ……はぁ、はぁ……」","english":"“Ah… nn… mmm, ngh… Ahh… haa, haa…”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000055","line":55,"sourceId":"0160:000055","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「……また震えてる」","english":"“…You’re trembling again.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000056","line":56,"sourceId":"0160:000056","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「くすぐったくて……」","english":"“It tickles…”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000057","line":57,"sourceId":"0160:000057","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「首筋、弱いんだ」","english":"“Your neck’s sensitive.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000058","line":58,"sourceId":"0160:000058","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「強い人がいたら見てみたいわ……急所よ、そこ」","english":"“I’d like to meet someone who wasn’t… It’s a vital spot.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000059","line":59,"sourceId":"0160:000059","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　もろく弱いからこその急所だとは理解できる。","english":"Of course it was a vital spot. Its very fragility made it one.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000060","line":60,"sourceId":"0160:000060","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　だから、優しく触れすぎればくすぐったいのだと、\nお互いが許し合えているからこそ触れられるのだと。","english":"Too light a touch would tickle. And they could touch each other there only because each had given the other permission.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000061","line":61,"sourceId":"0160:000061","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「はぁ、はぁ、あっ……んむ、\n　ん……んん、んぅ、ちゅむ」","english":"“Haa, haa… Ah… mmph, mm… mmm, ngh, mmmph.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000062","line":62,"sourceId":"0160:000062","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「ん、ん、ん、んん……ん～～\n　……っふは！　はぁ、はぁ、はぁ……」","english":"“Mm, mm, mm, mmm… Mmm— …Hah! Haa, haa, haa…”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000066","line":66,"sourceId":"0160:000066","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「……味は？　私の味はどう？」","english":"“…And the taste? How do I taste?”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000067","line":67,"sourceId":"0160:000067","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「美味しい？」","english":"“Good?”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000068","line":68,"sourceId":"0160:000068","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「尋ねられても……そうね、忍のは美味しいわ」","english":"“You ask me? …Well, you taste good, Shinobu.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000069","line":69,"sourceId":"0160:000069","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「そうか、これは美味しいんだね」","english":"“I see. So this is what good tastes like.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000070","line":70,"sourceId":"0160:000070","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「もっと食べる？」","english":"“Want another bite?”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000071","line":71,"sourceId":"0160:000071","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「食べるというか、飲む……んん」","english":"“It’s more like drinking than eating… Mmm.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000075","line":75,"sourceId":"0160:000075","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「んむ、んちゅ、んん……\n　ん、ん、んんぅ、ちゅむ、んん……～～っ！」","english":"“Mmph, mmph, mmm… Mm, mm, mmm, nnnh, mmmph, mmm…!”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000076","line":76,"sourceId":"0160:000076","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「ん、んんっ……た、食べてる……んん、んぁっ」","english":"“Mm, mmm… Y-you’re eating me… mmm, ngh.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000077","line":77,"sourceId":"0160:000077","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「痛い？」","english":"“Does it hurt?”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000078","line":78,"sourceId":"0160:000078","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「平気よ……でも、私も……ぁむ」","english":"“I’m fine… But I want to… mmph.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000079","line":79,"sourceId":"0160:000079","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「ん」","english":"“Mm.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000080","line":80,"sourceId":"0160:000080","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「ぁむ、ん、んちゅっ……\n　ちゅっ、んむん、ちゅっ……はむっ」","english":"“Mmph, mm, mmph… Mmph, nnmm, mmph… Mmm.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000081","line":81,"sourceId":"0160:000081","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　唇をついばみ合う。\n　上唇を、下唇を、そして時に舌までも。","english":"They nibbled at each other’s lips. The upper lip, the lower, and now and then even the tongue.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000085","line":85,"sourceId":"0160:000085","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「はぁ……ふにふにとして心地良いわね」","english":"“Haa… So soft. It feels lovely.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000086","line":86,"sourceId":"0160:000086","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「うん」","english":"“Yeah.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000087","line":87,"sourceId":"0160:000087","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「……噛み切っ」","english":"“…I could bite it clean—”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000088","line":88,"sourceId":"0160:000088","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「駄目、絶対」","english":"“No. Absolutely not.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000089","line":89,"sourceId":"0160:000089","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「…………冗談よ」","english":"“…………It was a joke.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000090","line":90,"sourceId":"0160:000090","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　惜しそうな目をしていた。","english":"She looked almost disappointed.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000094","line":94,"sourceId":"0160:000094","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「……ねぇ、忍」","english":"“…Shinobu.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000095","line":95,"sourceId":"0160:000095","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「あなたは、これからどうするの？」","english":"“What are you going to do from here on?”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000096","line":96,"sourceId":"0160:000096","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「どうって……」","english":"“What do you mean…?”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000097","line":97,"sourceId":"0160:000097","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　今この時のことではないと目で語る沙也加に、\n忍は言葉を詰まらせた。","english":"Sayaka’s eyes told him she did not mean the present moment, and Shinobu found himself at a loss for words.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000098","line":98,"sourceId":"0160:000098","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「それは、今考えなければいけないこと？」","english":"“Is that something I have to think about right now?”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000099","line":99,"sourceId":"0160:000099","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「……あぁそうね、野暮だったかしら」","english":"“…Ah, of course. Was that tactless of me?”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000100","line":100,"sourceId":"0160:000100","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「男と女のしとねで語らうことでは\n　なかったわね……許してちょうだい」","english":"“Not a subject for a man and woman to discuss upon the couch of love… Forgive me.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000101","line":101,"sourceId":"0160:000101","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「語っちゃいけないことなんてないと思うんだ」","english":"“I don’t think there’s anything we can’t talk about.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000102","line":102,"sourceId":"0160:000102","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「けど、今すぐに答えられることでもないから」","english":"“But it isn’t something I can answer right away.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000103","line":103,"sourceId":"0160:000103","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「そう、わかったわ……複雑なのね」","english":"“I see. I understand… It’s complicated.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000104","line":104,"sourceId":"0160:000104","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「…………」","english":"“…………”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000105","line":105,"sourceId":"0160:000105","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「私は簡単だわ。単純明快」","english":"“For me, it’s easy. Perfectly simple.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000106","line":106,"sourceId":"0160:000106","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「それは―――いや、いい」","english":"“That means— No. Never mind.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000107","line":107,"sourceId":"0160:000107","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「…………」","english":"“…………”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000108","line":108,"sourceId":"0160:000108","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「僕は、背負うだけだから」","english":"“All I can do is carry it.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000109","line":109,"sourceId":"0160:000109","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「抱きしめてはくれないの？」","english":"“Won’t you hold me?”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000110","line":110,"sourceId":"0160:000110","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「抱くよ、またこうして」","english":"“I will. I’ll hold you like this again.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000111","line":111,"sourceId":"0160:000111","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「そう。楽しみだわ」","english":"“I see. I’ll look forward to it.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000112","line":112,"sourceId":"0160:000112","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「なら、これからどうするの？」","english":"“Then what are you going to do now?”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000113","line":113,"sourceId":"0160:000113","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　今この時のこと。","english":"This time, she meant right now.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000114","line":114,"sourceId":"0160:000114","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「ん」","english":"“Mm.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000118","line":118,"sourceId":"0160:000118","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「ん……」","english":"“Mm…”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000122","line":122,"sourceId":"0160:000122","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「たくさん感じ合って……たくさん休もう」","english":"“Let’s feel all we can together… and then get plenty of rest.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000123","line":123,"sourceId":"0160:000123","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「このまま？」","english":"“Just as we are?”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000124","line":124,"sourceId":"0160:000124","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「そう、このまま……抱き合って」","english":"“Yes. Just like this… holding each other.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000125","line":125,"sourceId":"0160:000125","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「素敵な提案ね」","english":"“A lovely suggestion.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000126","line":126,"sourceId":"0160:000126","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「そう思ってもらえるなら嬉しいよ」","english":"“I’m glad you think so.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000127","line":127,"sourceId":"0160:000127","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「思うわ……これからもきっと」","english":"“I do… and I’m sure I always will.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000128","line":128,"sourceId":"0160:000128","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　これから先、幾度となく抱き合うことになるから。\n　沙也加は女性としての笑みをたたえて、忍に手を\n伸ばす。","english":"They would hold each other countless times to come. A woman’s smile on her lips, Sayaka reached out to Shinobu.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000129","line":129,"sourceId":"0160:000129","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「たくさん……して」","english":"“Do it… as much as you can.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000130","line":130,"sourceId":"0160:000130","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「うん」","english":"“I will.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000131","line":131,"sourceId":"0160:000131","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「ずっと……ずっと……」","english":"“Forever… forever…”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000135","line":135,"sourceId":"0160:000135","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「…………ずっと……」","english":"“…………Forever…”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000136","line":136,"sourceId":"0160:000136","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　他の言葉をすべて飲み込み、沙也加は身も心も\n忍に委ねる。","english":"Swallowing all her other words, Sayaka entrusted herself to Shinobu in body and soul.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0160:000137","line":137,"sourceId":"0160:000137","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　忍もそれを受け入れて、沙也加にそっと重なっ\nていく。","english":"Shinobu accepted that and gently lowered himself over her.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]}]}